### 1. Ambil Semua Data Mahasiswa
GET http://localhost:3000/students

### 2. Ambil Data Mahasiswa Berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3000/students/1

### 3. Tambah Data Mahasiswa Baru (Create)
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": "103022400111",
  "nama": "Farhan Maulana",
  "email": "farhan@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id",
  "jurusan": "S1 Informatika",
  "angkatan": 2024,
  "ipk": 3.78,
  "status": "AKTIF"
}

### 4. Perbarui Sebagian Data Mahasiswa (Update - PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/students/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jurusan": "S1 Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak",
  "ipk": 3.92
}

### 5. Hapus Data Mahasiswa (Delete)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/6

### 6. Bonus: Filter Lanjutan dengan Prisma where
GET http://localhost:3000/students/filter?jurusan=Rekayasa&minIpk=3.6&status=AKTIF

### 7. Bonus: Pencarian Bebas (Search nama / nim / email)
GET http://localhost:3000/students?search=Zulfan

### 8. Bonus: Statistik Mahasiswa (count, aggregate, groupBy)
GET http://localhost:3000/students/stats

### 9. Uji Validasi Error (400 Bad Request - Input tidak valid)
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": "",
  "nama": "Tanpa Email Valid",
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "jurusan": "S1 Informatika",
  "angkatan": 1990
}

### 10. Uji Not Found Error (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/students/9999
